  "Hmph. Kamu masih hijau.": "Hmph. You're still green.",
  "Aku tahu pasar ini punya reputasi buruk. Tapi sebagian besar pedagangnya orang kecil yang cari makan.": "I know this market has a bad reputation. But most of its traders are small people making a living.",
