  "Kolektif \"Saldo Balik\" menitipkan permintaan: buka buku besar aslinya dan buktikan angkanya dipalsukan. Butuh Cipher.": "The collective \"Saldo Balik\" has left a request: open the real ledger and prove the numbers were forged. You'll need Cipher.",
